    "summary": "A rank-128 LoRA on all 248 text projections of Qwen3.5-4B-Base (Apache-2.0), merged into the base weights, with a new candidate head; the release is the uniform weight average of four two-seed soups of that merged fine-tune (eight seeds of four training mixtures at half the learning rate). The Qwen3.5 vision tower is not part of it. The tokenizer files are Decision 1.0 Nox's (the Qwen3.5-4B vocabulary), unchanged from earlier revisions."
